<title>ITALY: CYCLING-ITALY'S CIPOLLINI WINS 10TH STAGE IN GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ITALY'S CIPOLLINI WINS 10TH STAGE IN GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>TARANTO, Italy 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mario Cipollini of Italy won the 195-km 10th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Monday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Italy's Endrio Leoni was second and his compatriot Fabio Baldato third, also according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Russian Pavel Tonkov retained the overall lead.</p>
</text>
